    {
      "id": 31575,
      "name": "Fire Wallet",
      "slug": "fire-wallet",
      "former_names": [],
      "small_logo_thumb_url": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/b24edcd9c30661e9d4cf818ec14536902f2b2c41.png",
      "website": "https://fire.co",
      "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA",
      "long_description": "🔥FIRE WALLET 🔥\r\n\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JeXDDegwhgA\r\n\r\nTL;DR: Fire Wallet is a fast, end-to-end encrypted, non-custodial stablecoin wallet with built-in payment processing and fiat on/off ramps, built by the team that created MobileCoin, the cryptocurrency inside Signal.\r\n\r\nHey Bookface! We're Josh, Michael, and Manny and we're building Fire Wallet!\r\n\r\n🔥Why we built this\r\n\r\nMost wallets and payment processors don’t work FOR you. They're slow, route your payments in the way that earns them the most, and they leak your financial life to anyone asking. Worse: every single one hold the keys to your money.\r\n\r\nWe believe your financial tools should act in your interest and, frankly, that your money should be yours.\r\n\r\n 🔥What Fire does\r\n\r\nMulti-chain, non-custodial, end-to-end encrypted wallet. \r\nYour keys, your money, your assets: you are in full control of your funds at all times. \r\nLeast Cost Routing. Every swap and payment takes the cheapest path, not the one that pays a middleman the most.\r\nSelf-sovereign payment processing. Send an invoice straight from the wallet. Get paid from your web checkout. No middleman.\r\nEasy fiat on/off ramps. Move stablecoins to USD and back without the pain.\r\nBuilt for agentic commerce. Manage per-agent sub-wallets for agentic workflows.\r\nEncrypted by default. Protecting you from bad actors and surveillance capitalism.\r\n\r\n🔥Early traction\r\n\r\nSigned our first major LOI with @Trustboop (founded by Justice Laub of Drone Racing League and Rob Rhinehart of Soylent).\r\n\r\nOnboarding our first enterprise customer in ecommerce packaging and marketing, doing about $1.5M/month in volume. They've connected us to 10 more companies in the same vertical at similar volume, roughly a $100M/yr GMV opportunity.\r\n\r\n🔥Why us\r\n\r\nJosh and Manuel led the creation of MobileCoin, the cryptocurrency in Signal Messenger: $100M+ raised, $1.16B peak valuation, $4B+ peak coin market cap, acquired in 2026.\r\n\r\nMichael runs product and design. He's an internationally exhibited artist with two published art books, and he builds sick products.\r\n\r\nManuel runs operations and orchestrates systems that actually work at scale.\r\n\r\n🔥Asks\r\n\r\nIntros to businesses moving $1M+/month in payments, especially cross-border, ecommerce, and DTC, who want lower fees and more control over their funds.\r\n\r\nStrategic partners in fintech and payments interested in integrating our infrastructure.\r\nTell us what's broken. Reply here or email founders@fire.co.\r\n\r\nWe're looking for our first 100 customers. If that's you or someone you know, we'd love to talk.",
      "one_liner": "Fire Wallet is a privacy-first crypto wallet designed to just work,…",
      "team_size": 3,
